==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Not too difficult of a level as you can farm peons forever. Since Hyppoh, Zory and Zomboe all come out at the same time, you just need to be prepared for the burrow and you should be fine. Rushing is a possibility as Hyppoh has a couple knockbacks and not too much health by the time you should be tackling this stage. Zory hits hard and attacks fast with area attacks, so get rid of him quick or your meatshields are gone. [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] will keep you from getting overwhelmed and make the stage very easy.

